                                "sense_id": "c5976427-2576-3af9-b663-1c9d844e9da5",
                                "text": "My adversary evermore twits me with my nephew, forsooth, my nephew: why may not a virtuous uncle have a dissolute nephew? What though he be a brotheller, a wastethrift, a common surfeiter, and, to conclude, a beggar, must sin in him call up shame in me?"
                            }
                        ]
